                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While it has a very good premise and the gameplay is decent, I can feel a bit of a lack of polish, no options for resolution or sound or any kind of graphical options, you get what you get. \n\nAlso the main part of a base building game is starting from the bottom and going to the top, in this you are thrown into it with basically no tutorial or any idea of the controls (which you cannot reconfigure I might add) basically it needs a overhaul of the whole start of the game.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1512793762,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1512794341,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 9,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5692982077598572,
                        "comment_count": 6,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Thank you for your review, and thank you for trying ASP!\n\nAs of this morning I am implementing tutorial popups into the base and loadout screens because of your feedback - sorry for the game being a bit unintuitive, and thank you for letting me know that it's an issue!\n\nWe hope to push the update by monday morning.",
